<pre class=metadata>
Title: CommonMark Emphasis
Group: test
Shortname: cm-emphasis
Level: 1
Status: LS
ED: http://example.com/cm-emphasis
Abstract: Testing CommonMark emphasis and strong emphasis rules in the unified parser.
Editor: Example Editor
Date: 1970-01-01
Markup Shorthands: markdown on, css off
Text Macro: EMPH-MACRO *from macro*
Text Macro: PLAIN-MACRO plain text
Text Macro: UNCLOSED-STAR unclosed *star
</pre>

<dfn export>term</dfn>

Multiline *emphasis spanning
two lines* in a paragraph.

<p>Multiline *emphasis spanning
two lines* inside explicit HTML p.</p>

Nesting: ***both***, ****four****, ***strong** then em*, *em then **strong***.

Rule 9 and 10:

* foo*bar**baz*qux
* *a****b*
* a***b***c

Punctuation flanking: *"quoted"*, (*parens*), *word*., void*} —*end note*.

Possessives: *object*'s, **bold**'s, '*quoted*'.

Inline HTML inside emphasis: *before <span>inside</span> after* and *line 1<br>line 2*.

No misnesting across HTML tags: <span>*opened in span</span> closed outside*.

<p>Unclosed *star in first auto-closed p.
<p>Unclosed *star in second auto-closed p.

<div>
Unclosed *star before child block.
<div>Child block</div>
Unclosed *star after child block.
</div>

<div>
Unclosed *star before blank line.

Unclosed *star after blank line.
</div>

Links and autolinks: [link *em*](https://example.com), *[link](https://example.com)*, [*broken](https://example.com)*, *[=term=]*, [=term|*custom em*=].

Macros: [EMPH-MACRO], *[PLAIN-MACRO]*, [UNCLOSED-STAR] and *unmatched.

<bs-macro name="UNCLOSED-STAR"></bs-macro>

Unmatched *star after bs-macro.

Opaque: <span bs-opaque>*opaque*</span> and `*code*`.

<pre>
*preformatted*
</pre>
